Data in this directory (track_2a/data/) is released under the Community Data License Agreement - Permissive - Version 2.0
(CDLA-Permissive-2.0), full text below. It contains identifiers, URLs, hashes, counts, labels and short quotations derived
from OpenParlData.ch exports and from documents published by Swiss parliaments and governments; no full document texts and
no personal contact data. ../results/LICENSE applies the same licence and attribution to the generated results.

Upstream terms and attribution
- OpenParlData.ch (the exports at files.openparldata.ch, the API at api.openparldata.ch): OPD's own API description
  states "We currently publish our data under the Creative Commons Licence CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Please attribute as: 'Source: OpenParlData.ch'" (the `info`
  section of https://api.openparldata.ch/openapi.json, version 1.1, as read on 7 Oct 2026). The material here derived
  from OPD's records keeps that attribution: Source: OpenParlData.ch. CDLA-Permissive-2.0 does not remove it; whoever
  shares OPD-derived rows further should carry the same attribution. For OPD's current terms see openparldata.ch.
- Documents of Swiss parliaments and governments: only identifiers, URLs, sha256 hashes, page numbers, counts and short
  quotations of them are included here, never the documents or their full texts; each document stays under its
  publisher's terms.
- Other upstream sources (Bern's open-data tables, Fedlex, the parliaments' own sites) are listed in
  ../technical_report.md (Data); no terms beyond those stated by each publisher are claimed here.

